# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. .env is git-ignored and
# must never be committed. No environment variables are required yet at the
# skeleton stage — this file exists so the pattern is in place before any
# API keys (contact form backend, analytics, map embeds, etc.) are added.
#
# Example (uncomment/add when a real backend/API is wired up):
# VITE_CONTACT_API_URL=
